-zhangzhao-wangjian"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-023-wangjian:p008","text":"　　上曲宴羣臣數人，各使效伎藝，褚淵彈琵琶，王僧虔彈琴，沈文季歌《子夜》，張敬兒舞，王敬則拍張。儉曰：「臣無所解，唯知誦書。」因跪上前誦相如《封禪書》。上笑曰：「此盛德之事，吾何以堪之。」後上使陸澄誦《孝經》，自「仲尼居」而起。儉曰：「澄所謂博而寡要，臣請誦之。」乃誦「《君子之事上》」章。上曰：「善！張子布更覺非奇也。」","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-023-wangjian:p008:m0016","person_id":"jyx_72x_8t2","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段實名及敘述視點。","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"褚淵"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-023-wangjian:p008:m0022","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEB","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段實名及敘述視點。","start":22,"end":25,"surface":"王僧虔"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-023-wangjian:p008:m0028","person_id":"408_ce3_5d8_A","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段實名及敘述視點。","start":28,"end":31,"surface":"沈文季"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-023-wangjian:p008:m0037","person_id":"stv_g27_gl2","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段實名及敘述視點。","start":37,"end":40,"surface":"張敬兒"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-023-wangjian:p008:m0042","person_id":"7a0_95e_c4a","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段實名及敘述視點。","start":42,"end":45,"surface":"王敬則"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-023-wangjian:p008:m0048","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段實名及敘述視點。","start":48,"end":49,"surface":"儉"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-023-wangjian:p008:m0068","person_id":"usb_lgr_ksa","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段實名及敘述視點。","start":68,"end":70,"surface":"相如"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-023-wangjian:p008:m0097","person_id":"77h_id3_a0i_AA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段實名及敘述視點。","start":97,"end":99,"surface":"陸澄"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-023-wangjian:p008:m0107","person_id":"fp6_ia6_7yw","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段實名及敘述視點。","start":107,"end":109,"surface":"仲尼"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-023-wangjian:p008:m0114","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段實名及敘述視點。","start":114,"end":115,"surface":"儉"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-023-wangjian:p008:m0118","person_id":"77h_id3_a0i_AA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段實名及敘述視點。","start":118,"end":119,"surface":"澄"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-023-wangjian:p008:m0151","person_id":"roi_rz4_ute","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段實名及敘述視點。","start":151,"end":154,"surface":"張子布"}],"source_position":{"revision_id":1545488,"first_line":77,"last_line":77,"raw_start":5704,"raw_end":5865,"line_start":0,"line_end":161,"source_layer":"received_biography"},"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-023-wangjian","book_id":"b-nanqishu-023","work_id":"w-nanqishu","source_id":"s-nanqishu-023-wangjian-ws1545488"},{"id":"c-nanshi-022-wangjian:p009","text":"帝幸樂遊宴集，謂儉曰：「卿好音樂，孰與朕同？」儉曰：「沐浴唐風，事兼比屋，亦既在齊，不知肉味。」帝稱善。後幸華林宴集，使各效伎藝。褚彥回彈琵琶，王僧虔、柳世隆彈琴，沈文季歌子夜來，張敬兒舞。儉曰：「臣無所解，唯知誦書。」因跪上前誦相如封禪書。上笑曰：「此盛德之事，吾何以堪之。」後上使陸澄誦孝經，起自「仲尼居」，儉曰：「澄所謂博而寡要。臣請誦之。」乃誦君子之事上章。上曰：「善，張子布更覺非奇也。」於是王敬則脫朝服袒，以絳糾髻，奮臂拍張，叫動左右。上不悅曰：「豈聞三公如此。」答曰：「臣以拍張，故得三公，不可忘拍張。」時以為名答。","mentions":[{"id":"c-nanshi-022-wangjian:p009:m0008","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAA","start":8,"end":9,"surface":"儉","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依該段姓名及上下文。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-022-wangjian:p009:m0023","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAA","start":23,"end":24,"surface":"儉","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依該段姓名及上下文。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-022-wangjian:p009:m0065","person_id":"jyx_72x_8t2","start":65,"end":68,"surfa